  "description": "Pure-managed GIF (87a / 89a) decoder and encoder for .NET. Decodes still and animated images (interlacing, transparency, every disposal method, loop count) to composited full-canvas RGBA frames with random access. Encodes stills and animations: lossless when the colours fit a palette, otherwise Wu quantization with optional Floyd-Steinberg dithering; opaque animations store only what changed. Spec-derived from the GIF89a specification. AOT-compatible.",
